@startuml
title SysMon - Storage Group Management Sequence Diagram

participant "SysMon Frontend" as Frontend
participant "SysMon Backend" as Backend
participant "SysMon Authentication System" as Auth

note over Frontend
  Admin (Tier 1 or 2) opens Manage Groups.
  At any step the admin may cancel: no request is sent.
end note

== List storage groups ==
Frontend -> Backend : GET /v1/storage-groups\nAuthorization: Bearer token
Backend -> Auth : GET /v1/auth/validate\nAuthorization: Bearer token
Auth --> Backend : 200 OK {userId, tier}\nor 401 Unauthorized

alt Token missing, invalid or expired
  Backend --> Frontend : 401 Unauthorized\n{code, message}
else Caller may not list storage groups
  Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden\n{code, message}
else All checks passed
  Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK\n[storage-group, ...]
end

note over Frontend, Backend
  The same 401 and 403 answers apply to every
  mutating request below unless stated otherwise.
end note

alt Create storage group
  note over Frontend
    Admin enters name and quotaBytes
    and commits Create New Storage Group.
  end note

  Frontend -> Backend : POST /v1/storage-groups\nAuthorization: Bearer token\nIdempotency-Key: key\n{name, quotaBytes}
  Backend -> Auth : GET /v1/auth/validate\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  Auth --> Backend : 200 OK {userId, tier}\nor 401 Unauthorized

  alt Token missing, invalid or expired
    Backend --> Frontend : 401 Unauthorized\n{code, message}
  else Caller is not Tier 1 or 2
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden\n{code, message}
  else Data invalid (empty name, non-positive quota)
    Backend --> Frontend : 422 Unprocessable Entity\n{code, field, message}
  else Quota exceeds free host disk space
    Backend --> Frontend : 422 Unprocessable Entity\n{code, field, message}
  else Name already taken
    Backend --> Frontend : 409 Conflict\n{code, message}
  else All checks passed
    Backend -> Backend : Provision bounded host directory
    Backend -> Backend : Record quota for the group
    Backend --> Frontend : 201 Created\nLocation: /v1/storage-groups/{storageGroupId}\n{storageGroupId, name, quotaBytes,\nhostPath, usedBytes, status, createdAt}
  end

else Modify storage group
  note over Frontend
    Admin selects an existing group, edits the
    quota (and optionally the display name) and confirms.
  end note

  Frontend -> Backend : PATCH /v1/storage-groups/{storageGroupId}\nAuthorization: Bearer token\n{name, quotaBytes}
  Backend -> Auth : GET /v1/auth/validate\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  Auth --> Backend : 200 OK {userId, tier}\nor 401 Unauthorized

  alt Token missing, invalid or expired
    Backend --> Frontend : 401 Unauthorized\n{code, message}
  else Caller is not Tier 1 or 2
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden\n{code, message}
  else Storage Group does not exist
    Backend --> Frontend : 404 Not Found\n{code, message}
  else Data invalid or quota exceeds free host disk space
    Backend --> Frontend : 422 Unprocessable Entity\n{code, field, message}
  else New quota is below current usedBytes
    Backend --> Frontend : 409 Conflict\n{code, message}
  else All checks passed
    Backend -> Backend : Apply updated quota to group
    note right of Backend
      Open question (US2): enforcement mechanism
      (filesystem quotas, sized volumes or
      periodic usage checks).
    end note
    Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK\n{storageGroupId, name, quotaBytes,\nhostPath, usedBytes, status, updatedAt}
  end

else Delete storage group
  note over Frontend
    Admin selects Delete Group and confirms
    in the deletion dialog.
  end note

  Frontend -> Backend : DELETE /v1/storage-groups/{storageGroupId}\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  Backend -> Auth : GET /v1/auth/validate\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  Auth --> Backend : 200 OK {userId, tier}\nor 401 Unauthorized

  alt Token missing, invalid or expired
    Backend --> Frontend : 401 Unauthorized\n{code, message}
  else Caller is not Tier 1 or 2
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden\n{code, message}
  else Storage Group does not exist
    Backend --> Frontend : 404 Not Found\n{code, message}
  else Group still has assigned users or bound volumes
    Backend --> Frontend : 409 Conflict\n{code, message}
  else All checks passed
    Backend -> Backend : Remove quota record and host directory
    Backend --> Frontend : 204 No Content
  end
end

@enduml
